@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor User
participant "Next.js Unified Work Area" as Web
participant "FastAPI Conversation Route" as API
participant "Authorisation Service" as Authz
participant "Conversation Engine" as Engine
participant "Task Classifier" as Classifier
participant "Source Discovery" as Sources
participant "Model Router" as Router
participant "Citation Integrity Guard" as Guard
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> Web: Submit teaching request
Web -> API: POST /conversations/{id}/messages
API -> Authz: require ai.use for active role
Authz -> DB: validate scoped role permission
Authz --> API: allowed
API -> Engine: submit_message()
Engine -> DB: persist user message + AI request
Engine -> Classifier: classify request
Classifier --> Engine: task, privacy, source/review needs
opt sources materially required
  Engine -> Sources: retrieve verified metadata
  Sources --> Engine: source pack
end
Engine -> Router: generate(prompt, privacy)
Router --> Engine: provider response + attempts
Engine -> Guard: validate markers, URLs, DOIs
Guard --> Engine: sanitised output + warnings
Engine -> DB: persist attempts, assistant message,
output version, retrievals, citations, audit
Engine --> API: unified response contract
API --> Web: inline output + source cards
Web --> User: Render in same conversation
@enduml
